  metaDescription="Report a problem with your Smart Vend NC machine — jams, card reader issues, restock requests, or anything else. Our local team responds fast."
  badge="Support"
  heading="Submit a Support Request"
  subheading="Need help with a recent transaction or want to report an issue with the machine? Share the details and our Triangle-based team will get on it — usually the same day."
  formSlug="support-request-b699ef"
  notice="Submitting this form is the quickest way to reach the right team and get a faster response — quicker than calling or emailing."
  icon={`<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M18.364 5.636l-3.536 3.536m0 5.656l3.536 3.536M9.172 9.172L5.636 5.636m3.536 9.192l-3.536 3.536M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-5 0a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0z"/>`}
  points={[
    "We monitor requests during business hours, Mon–Fri 8am–5pm.",
    "Most issues are resolved within one business day.",
    "Urgent? Call us and we'll prioritize your machine.",
    "Include the machine location so we can find it fast.",
  ]}
/>
